<title>USA: Admor Memory names John Onder CFO.</title>
<headline>Admor Memory names John Onder CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Admor Memory Corp appointed of John Onder as the company's chief operating officer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Onder was most recently president and chief executive officer of American Racing Equipment, a $250 million automotive original equipment manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to say whether the position was newly created.</p>
